{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "notes-api-assignment-01-crud",
    "name": "Notes Management REST API — Assignment 01",
    "description": "Complete REST API for Notes Management built with Node.js + Express + MongoDB (Mongoose).\n\nAuthor: Anisha Chhajer\nCourse: Backend with Node.js\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:5000/api/notes`\n\n**Response Format (all endpoints):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true | false,\n  \"message\": \"...\",\n  \"data\": {} | [] | null\n}\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL of the server. Change this if deployed."
    },
    {
      "key": "noteId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Paste a valid MongoDB ObjectId here after creating a note."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Create Note (POST /api/notes)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has success: true\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response message is correct\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.eql(\"Note created successfully\");",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response data contains _id\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"_id\");",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"noteId\", json.data._id);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Team standup agenda\",\n  \"content\": \"Discuss sprint blockers and deployment plan\",\n  \"category\": \"work\",\n  \"isPinned\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/notes",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "notes"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
